  "en": "He said he was trying to steal luggage from the airport.",
  "start": 1039.84,
  "end": 1042.31
 },
 {
  "en": "He's got five million dollars. Why would he--?",
  "start": 1044.44,
  "end": 1046.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Unless he doesn't have it.",
  "start": 1054.52,
  "end": 1056.58
 },
 {
  "en": "Unless he lost it there.",
  "start": 1057.82,
  "end": 1059.15
 },
 {
  "en": "Stop it, Fernando.",
  "start": 1059.32,
  "end": 1061.69
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 1059.32,
  "end": 1061.69
 },
 {
  "en": "Do you really believe that that money is at the airport?",
  "start": 1061.86,
  "end": 1064.92
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, forget it. Look at what we have together.",
  "start": 1065.63,
  "end": 1069.93
 },
 {
  "en": "Do you really wanna risk that?",
  "start": 1070.1,
  "end": 1072.16
 },
 {
  "en": "We have everything that we need.",
  "start": 1072.64,
  "end": 1075.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Except your cerezas.",
  "start": 1075.91,
  "end": 1078.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Right.",
  "start": 1075.91,
  "end": 1078.0
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll be right back.",
  "start": 1081.11,
  "end": 1082.58
 },
 {
  "en": "Fernando.",
  "start": 1082.85,
  "end": 1084.32
 },
 {
  "en": "Baby. I'll be right back.",
  "start": 1096.8,
  "end": 1100.39
 },
 {
  "en": "You gotta know it's not real hard for me to recognize a junkie.",
  "start": 1133.7,
  "end": 1137.19
 },
 {
  "en": "I-- l-- I'm saying you don't look so good.",
  "start": 1137.7,
  "end": 1142.07
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm fine.",
  "start": 1145.51,
  "end": 1147.0
 },
 {
  "en": "You mind me asking what you're taking?",
  "start": 1149.68,
  "end": 1151.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Here, you want one?",
  "start": 1153.65,
  "end": 1156.05
 },
 {
  "en": "No, that's okay.",
  "start": 1153.65,
  "end": 1156.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Save it for later.",
  "start": 1158.59,
  "end": 1160.32
 },
 {
  "en": "Varatril.",
  "start": 1164.16,
  "end": 1165.79
 },
 {
  "en": "Benzodiazepine's a hard-core tranquilizer, man.",
  "start": 1168.13,
  "end": 1171.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Take these every day?",
  "start": 1171.47,
  "end": 1173.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Twenty milligrams.",
  "start": 1174.41,
  "end": 1176.37
 },
 {
  "en": "You must feel like you're walking underwater.",
  "start": 1178.28,
  "end": 1181.18
 },
 {
  "en": "I do.",
  "start": 1182.45,
  "end": 1183.85
 },
 {
  "en": "It's very quiet down here.",
  "start": 1184.82,
  "end": 1186.84
 },
 {
  "en": "That's why you started, right? The peace and quiet?",
  "start": 1187.59,
  "end": 1190.52
 },
 {
  "en": "That's not why you do it anymore though, is it?",
  "start": 1191.22,
  "end": 1193.66
 },
 {
  "en": "Now it's the headaches, right? And you probably don't sleep.",
  "start": 1196.09,
  "end": 1199.36
 },
 {
  "en": "And you know you're gonna destroy yourself, right?",
  "start": 1201.63,
  "end": 1204.36
 },
 {
  "en": "I haven't ruled that out as a possibility.",
  "start": 1207.07,
  "end": 1209.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Hope we hear from your boyfriend.",
  "start": 1212.74,
  "end": 1214.94
 },
 {
  "en": "There's one difference between me and Agent Mahone.",
  "start": 1219.45,
  "end": 1221.78
 },
 {
  "en": "He doesn't know the value of a bird in the hand. He keeps beating around that bush.",
  "start": 1222.72,
  "end": 1226.85
 },
 {
  "en": "But if you don't give up Burrows, I don't care.",
  "start": 1227.03,
  "end": 1229.69
 },
 {
  "en": "One down, one to go.",
  "start": 1233.63,
  "end": 1237.43
 },
 {
  "en": "I need to talk to Mr. Scofield.",
  "start": 1233.63,
  "end": 1237.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Alone.",
  "start": 1237.8,
  "end": 1238.89
 },
 {
  "en": "Madam President.",
  "start": 1273.84,
  "end": 1275.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Could I...",
  "start": 1276.38,
  "end": 1277.87
 },
 {
  "en": "... have a word?",
  "start": 1279.31,
  "end": 1281.07
 },
 {
  "en": "It wouldn't be prudent for me to leave you alone with Mr. Scofield",
  "start": 1282.65,
  "end": 1285.62
 },
 {
  "en": "My men are right outside this door. I have a right to privacy.",
  "start": 1285.78,
  "end": 1289.48
 },
 {
  "en": "Your rights...",
  "start": 1289.65,
  "end": 1291.82
 },
 {
  "en": "... aren't my first concern.",
  "start": 1291.99,
  "end": 1293.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Do I need to remind you who you are talking to?",
  "start": 1293.36,
  "end": 1296.45
 },
 {
  "en": "Step outside and close the door behind you.",
  "start": 1296.63,
  "end": 1301.0
 },
 {
  "en": "The things you do for your brother.",
  "start": 1325.32,
  "end": 1328.69
 },
 {
  "en": "It's impressive.",
  "start": 1329.06,
  "end": 1330.86
 },
 {
  "en": "I could say the same for you.",
  "start": 1331.2,
  "end": 1333.66
 },
 {
  "en": "But I won't.",
  "start": 1336.03,
  "end": 1337.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Bear in mind...",
  "start": 1336.03,
  "end": 1337.59
 },
 {
  "en": "... your opinion means little to me.",
  "start": 1337.77,
  "end": 1340.67
 },
 {
  "en": "This tape.",
  "start": 1341.17,
  "end": 1343.0
 },
 {
  "en": "You have it with you?",
  "start": 1343.47,
  "end": 1345.7
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 1346.35,
  "end": 1347.81
 },
 {
  "en": "But I can arrange for you to hear it.",
  "start": 1349.05,
  "end": 1351.88
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't make arrangements for me, Mr. Scofield.",
  "start": 1353.59,
  "end": 1357.92
 },
 {
  "en": "I have people for that.",
  "start": 1358.09,
  "end": 1360.52
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not exactly sure what is on this tape...",
  "start": 1361.13,
  "end": 1365.09
 },
 {
  "en": "... but I doubt it's of any interest to me.",
  "start": 1365.26,
  "end": 1368.1
 },
 {
  "en": "It's a recorded conversation between you and your brother.",
  "start": 1368.27,
  "end": 1371.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, out of millions of conversations that I had with my brother during his lifetime",
  "start": 1371.6,
  "end": 1376.23
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll narrow it down for you.",
  "start": 1376.41,
  "end": 1378.38
 },
 {
  "en": "It was recorded sometime after his death.",
  "start": 1378.88,
  "end": 1382.97
 },
 {
  "en": "And this...",
  "start": 1384.75,
  "end": 1386.08
 },
 {
  "en": "... particular conversation...",
  "start": 1386.85,
  "end": 1389.68
 },
 {
  "en": "... you might wanna keep in the family.",
  "start": 1391.72,
  "end": 1394.21
 },
 {
  "en": "And where is it?",
  "start": 1397.26,
  "end": 1399.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Twenty different copies in 20 different locations.",
  "start": 1399.33,
  "end": 1402.86
 },
 {
  "en": "I can call my brother right now.",
  "start": 1403.27,
  "end": 1405.74
 },
 {
  "en": "He can play it for you.",
  "start": 1405.9,
  "end": 1407.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Not on the phone. Have him bring it here.",
  "start": 1407.77,
  "end": 1410.9
 },
 {
  "en": "These are the terms.",
  "start": 1412.24,
  "end": 1413.9
 },
 {
  "en": "You can hear it over the phone...",
  "start": 1415.35,
  "end": 1417.97
 },
 {
  "en": "... or you can hear it on the news.",
  "start": 1418.45,
  "end": 1421.08
 },
 {
  "en": "It's up to you.",
  "start": 1422.45,
  "end": 1424.18
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, it's why I started.",
  "start": 1428.46,
  "end": 1430.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Started what?",
  "start": 1431.06,
  "end": 1432.65
 },
 {
  "en": "Using. Same reason as you.",
  "start": 1433.13,
  "end": 1435.33
 },
 {
  "en": "Why? Because you had to stay up all night during residency?",
  "start": 1435.5,
  "end": 1438.37
 },
 {
  "en": "Because the bass player dumped you in front of the whole sorority?",
  "start": 1440.27,
  "end": 1443.33
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, you and I got a lot in common.",
  "start": 1443.51,
  "end": 1445.63
 },
 {
  "en": "I've seen people die too.",
  "start": 1446.58,
  "end": 1448.48
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm assuming you didn't make them die.",
  "start": 1449.48,
  "end": 1452.24
 },
 {
  "en": "You need help.",
  "start": 1453.02,
  "end": 1454.68
 },
 {
  "en": "Not what I'm looking for.",
  "start": 1455.29,
  "end": 1457.45
 },
 {
  "en": "For your sake, I hope your boyfriend calls back real soon.",
  "start": 1463.06,
  "end": 1465.62
 },
 {
  "en": "Maricruz?",
  "start": 1494.99,
  "end": 1496.79
 },
 {
  "en": "Where the hell's everybody?",
  "start": 1501.13,
  "end": 1502.96
 },
 {
  "en": "Mami?",
  "start": 1506.57,
  "end": 1508.06
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, lookie here. Good old Sucre.",
  "start": 1511.78,
  "end": 1514.64
 },
 {
  "en": "What'd you do? Where are they? Maricruz.",
  "start": 1514.81,
  "end": 1516.75
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, hey, hey. Keep your cap on.",
  "start": 1516.91,
  "end": 1519.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Out picking apples for the Snuffaluffagus.",
  "start": 1519.78,
  "end": 1521.78
 },
 {
  "en": "If you ever",
  "start": 1522.22,
  "end": 1523.62
 },
 {
  "en": "Calm down.",
  "start": 1522.22,
  "end": 1523.62
 },
 {
  "en": "They're gonna walk back in here any minute.",
  "start": 1523.79,
  "end": 1526.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Which means trouble.",
  "start": 1526.66,
  "end": 1528.49
 },
 {
  "en": "Unless you wanna see me try out the new T-20-Z on your bella muchacha Mari-poon.",
  "start": 1528.96,
  "end": 1534.3
 },
 {
  "en": "I think you better come with me.",
  "start": 1535.93,
  "end": 1538.13
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah?",
  "start": 1544.48,
  "end": 1545.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Lincoln Burrows?",
  "start": 1546.21,
  "end": 1548.41
 },
 {
  "en": "Caroline Reynolds.",
  "start": 1549.01,
  "end": 1550.41
 },
 {
  "en": "I understand you have something for me.",
  "start": 1551.42,
  "end": 1555.22
 },
 {
  "en": "You still there?",
  "start": 1559.76,
  "end": 1562.12
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, I'm here.",
  "start": 1559.76,
  "end": 1562.12
 },
 {
  "en": "It's good to finally talk to you.",
  "start": 1562.63,
  "end": 1565.03
 },
 {
  "en": "Wish I had the chance one of those 242 nights I spent on death row, you",
  "start": 1565.46,
  "end": 1569.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Please, just play the tape.",
  "start": 1569.97,
  "end": 1572.99
 },
 {
  "en": "It's awful, I know.",
  "start": 1582.05,
  "end": 1584.52
 },
 {
  "en": "But the choice was clear. You needed to be far away from all of this.",
  "start": 1584.85,
  "end": 1589.18
 },
 {
  "en": "I am. I'm the Isle of Terrence, far off to sea.",
  "start": 1589.35,
  "end": 1592.81
 },
 {
  "en": "But I'm still here for you.",
  "start": 1592.99,
  "end": 1595.48
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, listen to me. Don't dwell on the negative.",
  "start": 1595.66,
  "end": 1598.89
 },
 {
  "en": "Some people deserve to dwell, Caroline.",
  "start": 1599.06,
  "end": 1601.12
 },
 {
  "en": "You know I'm only a phone call away.",
  "start": 1601.3,
  "end": 1604.27
 },
 {
  "en": "And three thousand miles.",
  "start": 1605.64,
  "end": 1608.13
 },
 {
  "en": "Do you know how cold it is here?",
  "start": 1611.51,
  "end": 1614.24
 },
 {
  "en": "We talked about this, Terrence.",
  "start": 1614.41,
  "end": 1616.64
 },
 {
  "en": "You knew that you would be lonely, but it's only temporary.",
  "start": 1616.82,
  "end": 1619.91
 },
 {
  "en": "His appeals process has started already.",
  "start": 1620.09,
  "end": 1622.45
 },
 {
  "en": "This is gonna fly by quicker than your 20s.",
  "start": 1622.62,
  "end": 1625.56
 },
 {
  "en": "And soon the world will forget all about him...",
  "start": 1625.72,
  "end": 1629.32
 },
 {
  "en": "... and they'll forget about you too. I promise.",
  "start": 1629.49,
  "end": 1632.46
 },
 {
  "en": "But...",
  "start": 1632.63,
  "end": 1634.1
 },
 {
  "en": "... it's killing me not being able to see you...",
  "start": 1635.33,
  "end": 1639.0
 },
 {
  "en": "... sweet Caroline.",
  "start": 1639.17,
  "end": 1642.11
 },
 {
  "en": "I wanna see you too.",
  "start": 1639.17,
  "end": 1642.11
 },
 {
  "en": "But that can't happen right now.",
  "start": 1642.27,
  "end": 1646.0
 },
 {
  "en": "This house is so big.",
  "start": 1642.27,
  "end": 1646.0
 },
 {
  "en": "I just-- I just think of you...",
  "start": 1646.18,
  "end": 1648.74
 },
 {
  "en": "... lying in bed.",
  "start": 1649.85,
  "end": 1651.75
 },
 {
  "en": "I know. Me too.",
  "start": 1652.22,
  "end": 1655.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Your warmth, your touch.",
  "start": 1652.22,
  "end": 1655.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Was it quick...",
  "start": 1665.06,
  "end": 1666.22
 },
 {
  "en": "... when he killed himself?",
  "start": 1667.87,
  "end": 1669.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, it was a lot quicker than how my father died.",
  "start": 1670.9,
  "end": 1673.37
 },
 {
  "en": "They shot him in the back.",
  "start": 1673.54,
  "end": 1675.51
 },
 {
  "en": "He died in my arms.",
  "start": 1676.81,
  "end": 1678.67
 },
 {
  "en": "I just wanna know what happened.",
  "start": 1679.78,
  "end": 1681.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Your brother apologized.",
  "start": 1683.78,
  "end": 1686.31
 },
 {
  "en": "He said he was sorry and then he blew his brains out all over the wall.",
  "start": 1687.75,
  "end": 1692.09
 },
 {
  "en": "It was quick...",
  "start": 1694.46,
  "end": 1696.09
 },
 {
  "en": "... and it was his decision.",
  "start": 1696.29,
  "end": 1698.19
 },
 {
  "en": "And now it's time for you to make yours.",
  "start": 1699.33,
  "end": 1701.53
 },
 {
  "en": "No, no, no, no. Man, you know, l-- I can't-- I can't do it. I can't do that.",
  "start": 1708.97,
  "end": 1712.93
 },
 {
  "en": "Yes, you can.",
  "start": 1713.85,
  "end": 1715.47
 },
 {
  "en": "There's nothing to be afraid of.",
  "start": 1716.08,
  "end": 1718.38
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't get it, do you?",
  "start": 1718.78,
  "end": 1720.27
 },
 {
  "en": "You can't stop this guy.",
  "start": 1721.09,
  "end": 1723.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Not without your cooperation, I can't. But if you talk to me...",
  "start": 1723.56,
  "end": 1727.32
 },
 {
  "en": "... if you tell me what's going on, I can take care of you, okay?",
  "start": 1728.33,
  "end": 1731.39
 },
 {
  "en": "You've gotta trust me, Mr. Franklin.",
  "start": 1731.56,
  "end": 1733.62
 },
 {
  "en": "I can help you.",
  "start": 1734.27,
  "end": 1736.23
 },
 {
  "en": "C-Note, right?",
  "start": 1738.84,
  "end": 1740.07
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, whatever.",
  "start": 1741.34,
  "end": 1743.14
 },
 {
  "en": "All I need you to do is tell me exactly what Agent Mahone told you.",
  "start": 1748.71,
  "end": 1752.67
 },
 {
  "en": "If you give me Mahone, I'll give you your life back.",
  "start": 1754.59,
  "end": 1758.11
 },
 {
  "en": "God's been smiling down on me, I can tell you that.",
  "start": 1758.82,
  "end": 1761.55
 },
 {
  "en": "First I caught up to Haywire up in Algoma.",
  "start": 1761.73,
  "end": 1763.66
 },
 {
  "en": "He did a dive off an elevator before they could put him away...",
  "start": 1763.83,
  "end": 1766.69
 },
 {
  "en": "... but I still get the reward.",
  "start": 1766.87,
  "end": 1769.42
 },
 {
  "en": "Wait, wait. He's dead?",
  "start": 1766.87,
  "end": 1769.42
 },
 {
  "en": "Yep. Like a gnat on a Peterbilt. Hope you don't take the same route, Sucre.",
  "start": 1769.6,
  "end": 1772.93
 },
 {
  "en": "Hell, no. I got plenty reasons to live.",
  "start": 1773.1,
  "end": 1776.73
 },
 {
  "en": "I hope a few of them are in Fox River.",
  "start": 1773.1,
  "end": 1776.73
 },
 {
  "en": "Or maybe if you play nice, I'll throw your Maricruz a couple of bills.",
  "start": 1776.91,
  "end": 1780.14
 },
 {
  "en": "After I turn you in.",
  "start": 1780.31,
  "end": 1782.78
 },
 {
  "en": "How much are you getting for us?",
  "start": 1780.31,
  "end": 1782.78
 },
 {
  "en": "A hundred grand. I bet you never thought your ass would be worth all that.",
  "start": 1782.95,
  "end": 1786.68
 },
 {
  "en": "Wait, wait, wait.",
  "start": 1786.85,
  "end": 1788.68
 },
 {
  "en": "What if I know where you can get 5 million dollars?",
  "start": 1789.39,
  "end": 1792.82
 },
 {
  "en": "You heard me.",
  "start": 1796.09,
  "end": 1797.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Where is it?",
  "start": 1798.83,
  "end": 1802.16
 },
 {
  "en": "I could take you there...",
  "start": 1798.83,
  "end": 1802.16
 },
 {
  "en": "... if you didn't have to take me back to the States and turn me back in.",
  "start": 1802.47,
  "end": 1806.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Where is it?",
  "start": 1806.9,
  "end": 1808.6
 },
 {
  "en": "T-Bag's in town.",
  "start": 1811.28,
  "end": 1813.21
 },
 {
  "en": "I made my commitment a long time ago.",
  "start": 1814.24,
  "end": 1817.31
 },
 {
  "en": "I agreed to put my country ahead of myself, like a mother does for a child.",
  "start": 1818.02,
  "end": 1823.82
 },
 {
  "en": "And I thought...",
  "start": 1826.32,
  "end": 1828.22
 },
 {
  "en": "... that what I was doing was noble and that I would be rewarded.",
  "start": 1828.86,
  "end": 1832.92
 },
 {
  "en": "You were wrong.",
  "start": 1833.1,
  "end": 1834.26
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't you see that I'm a pawn in this too?",
  "start": 1834.43,
  "end": 1838.6
 },
 {
  "en": "The power that has taken over this country...",
  "start": 1839.3,
  "end": 1842.1
 },
 {
  "en": "... is like a cancer and it will stop at nothing.",
  "start": 1842.27,
  "end": 1846.0
 },
 {
  "en": "It is out of my control.",
  "start": 1846.28,
  "end": 1850.08
 },
 {
  "en": "So is this.",
  "start": 1846.28,
  "end": 1850.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Tell me what you want from me.",
  "start": 1850.62,
  "end": 1853.17
 },
 {
  "en": "Uncuff me.",
  "start": 1854.48,
  "end": 1856.04
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't have the keys.",
  "start": 1856.52,
  "end": 1858.61
 },
 {
  "en": "You'll get them.",
  "start": 1856.52,
  "end": 1858.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Second, I want you to arrange for me to walk away from here alone.",
  "start": 1858.79,
  "end": 1861.92
 },
 {
  "en": "No surveillance.",
  "start": 1862.09,
  "end": 1863.75
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay.",
  "start": 1865.36,
  "end": 1866.42
 },
 {
  "en": "And finally...",
  "start": 1867.37,
  "end": 1869.23
 },
 {
  "en": "... I want a presidential pardon for me and my brother...",
  "start": 1870.3,
  "end": 1874.8
 },
 {
  "en": "... fully exonerating us of all our crimes.",
  "start": 1874.97,
  "end": 1878.1
 },
 {
  "en": "And I want it today.",
  "start": 1878.28,
  "end": 1880.37
 },
 {
  "en": "I can't just hand out pardons to anyone I choose.",
  "start": 1889.89,
  "end": 1893.79
 },
 {
  "en": "There is a process, rules.",
  "start": 1893.96,
  "end": 1897.69
 },
 {
  "en": "This is no exception.",
  "start": 1893.96,
  "end": 1897.69
 },
 {
  "en": "A document will be delivered for your approval just like any pardon.",
  "start": 1897.86,
  "end": 1901.16
 },
 {
  "en": "You'll sign it and then file it...",
  "start": 1901.33,
  "end": 1903.16
 },
 {
  "en": "... with the attorney general, who'll submit it to Presidential Record.",
  "start": 1903.33,
  "end": 1906.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Fine. I will sign whatever you need me to sign.",
  "start": 1906.6,
  "end": 1909.87
 },
 {
  "en": "That's very kind. But we both know that's not enough.",
  "start": 1910.04,
  "end": 1912.7
 },
 {
  "en": "What do you want from me?",
  "start": 1912.88,
  "end": 1914.97
 },
 {
  "en": "I will unlock you myself, walk you out of here.",
  "start": 1915.15,
  "end": 1918.34
 },
 {
  "en": "What, you want me to drive you to the airport?",
  "start": 1918.52,
  "end": 1920.92
 },
 {
  "en": "I guess I'm not as trusting as I used to be. Especially with paperwork.",
  "start": 1921.09,
  "end": 1924.35
 },
 {
  "en": "It's so easy to lose.",
  "start": 1924.52,
  "end": 1926.46
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, I want you to go out there in front of everyone...",
  "start": 1926.62,
  "end": 1929.42
 },
 {
  "en": "... and announce our full pardon on live TV.",
  "start": 1929.59,
  "end": 1932.93
 },
 {
  "en": "You're insane.",
  "start": 1934.33,
  "end": 1936.1
 },
 {
  "en": "That is not the way things are done.",
  "start": 1936.27,
  "end": 1938.6
 },
 {
  "en": "This is not a vacuum. People will ask questions.",
  "start": 1938.77,
  "end": 1941.14
 },
 {
  "en": "Pardon. On stage. Now.",
  "start": 1941.31,
  "end": 1944.83
 },
 {
  "en": "And how do I know that you won't release the tape an hour later?",
  "start": 1948.81,
  "end": 1954.38
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't.",
  "start": 1955.79,
  "end": 1957.22
 },
 {
  "en": "You'll just have to take my word for it.",
  "start": 1957.99,
  "end": 1960.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, I need more than that.",
  "start": 1961.59,
  "end": 1965.26
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, you're not gonna get it.",
  "start": 1961.59,
  "end": 1965.26
 },
 {
  "en": "Caroline...",
  "start": 1969.53,
  "end": 1971.02
 },
 {
  "en": "... it's time.",
  "start": 1972.14,
  "end": 1973.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Make your choice.",
  "start": 1974.51,
  "end": 1976.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Adams, I need you to uncuff the detainee and bring him here to be released.",
  "start": 1982.58,
  "end": 1988.38
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you doing?",
  "start": 1988.95,
  "end": 1991.68
 },
 {
  "en": "I am going to make an announcement pardoning Mr. Scofield and his brother...",
  "start": 1991.92,
  "end": 1996.09
 },
 {
  "en": "... and he will walk away unharmed.",
  "start": 1996.26,
  "end": 1998.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you out of your mind?",
  "start": 1999.16,
  "end": 2000.26
 },
 {
  "en": "He has brought some indisputable evidence to light.",
  "start": 2001.27,
  "end": 2004.83
 },
 {
  "en": "We could end this all, right now.",
  "start": 2005.0,
  "end": 2008.27
 },
 {
  "en": "You're gonna let them walk?",
  "start": 2008.44,
  "end": 2009.74
 },
 {
  "en": "I am the commander in chief, and you are a corporate lackey.",
  "start": 2009.91,
  "end": 2014.28
 },
 {
  "en": "I am making the calls now. You have no authority.",
  "start": 2014.68,
  "end": 2017.74
 },
 {
  "en": "My men will see to it...",
  "start": 2019.65,
  "end": 2021.95
 },
 {
  "en": "... that Mr. Scofield walks away without the interference...",
  "start": 2022.12,
  "end": 2025.65
 },
 {
  "en": "... of you and your pit bulls.",
  "start": 2025.82,
  "end": 2028.92
 },
 {
  "en": "You alone?",
  "start": 2062.79,
  "end": 2065.13
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 2062.79,
  "end": 2065.13
 },
 {
  "en": "How'd you do?",
  "start": 2067.03,
  "end": 2070.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Three tickets, one cabin, one way.",
  "start": 2067.03,
  "end": 2070.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Nice.",
  "start": 2070.33,
  "end": 2071.77
 },
 {
  "en": "I owe you.",
  "start": 2072.14,
  "end": 2074.97
 },
 {
  "en": "No. We're even.",
  "start": 2072.14,
  "end": 2074.97
 },
 {
  "en": "These are for you.",
  "start": 2075.14,
  "end": 2076.77
 },
 {
  "en": "Nice.",
  "start": 2075.14,
  "end": 2076.77
 },
 {
  "en": "And this.",
  "start": 2077.28,
  "end": 2078.67
 },
 {
  "en": "What's this?",
  "start": 2081.85,
  "end": 2084.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Eddie. When you broke out...",
  "start": 2081.85,
  "end": 2084.08
 },
 {
  "en": "... he bet me a hundred bucks you'd be caught in a week.",
  "start": 2084.25,
  "end": 2086.68
 },
 {
  "en": "I said, no way. Not the Linc I know.",
  "start": 2086.85,
  "end": 2088.88
 },
 {
  "en": "Figured I'd split it with you.",
  "start": 2089.05,
  "end": 2091.11
 },
 {
  "en": "So this is it, huh?",
  "start": 2093.42,
  "end": 2094.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 2095.53,
  "end": 2096.89
 },
 {
  "en": "Good luck.",
  "start": 2098.23,
  "end": 2099.63
 },
 {
  "en": "You take care. All right.",
  "start": 2102.0,
  "end": 2104.3
 },
 {
  "en": "You too.",
  "start": 2102.0,
  "end": 2104.3
 },
 {
  "en": "You be safe.",
  "start": 2104.97,
  "end": 2106.56
 },
 {
  "en": "This is your neck of the woods.",
  "start": 2130.53,
  "end": 2133.39
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah. How's Third and Racine?",
  "start": 2130.53,
  "end": 2133.39
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll be there.",
  "start": 2133.56,
  "end": 2135.26
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't wanna do this. I really don't.",
  "start": 2142.87,
  "end": 2145.0
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you talking about?",
  "start": 2146.21,
  "end": 2147.84
 },
 {
  "en": "You can't say that I didn't give you a choice...",
  "start": 2148.01,
  "end": 2150.28
 },
 {
  "en": "... you never take the easy way. You",
  "start": 2150.45,
  "end": 2152.35
 },
 {
  "en": "And I noticed that about you. You",
  "start": 2152.75,
  "end": 2155.08
 },
 {
  "en": "I should never expect it to be any different but I have a job to do...",
  "start": 2155.25,
  "end": 2159.05
 },
 {
  "en": "... a job that I'm being made to do.",
  "start": 2159.22,
  "end": 2162.42
 },
 {
  "en": "Pick it up, Sara.",
  "start": 2165.1,
  "end": 2166.09
 },
 {
  "en": "Sara, pick it up.",
  "start": 2167.66,
  "end": 2168.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Pick up.",
  "start": 2169.9,
  "end": 2172.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Wait, wait.",
  "start": 2169.9,
  "end": 2172.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't move.",
  "start": 2174.64,
  "end": 2176.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Just don't-- Don't move.",
  "start": 2176.34,
  "end": 2179.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay, I need the phone. Give me the phone.",
  "start": 2180.84,
  "end": 2182.87
 },
 {
  "en": "Stay right where you are, please.",
  "start": 2184.25,
  "end": 2186.34
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't really wanna do this.",
  "start": 2188.39,
  "end": 2189.85
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't know the first thing about what I want.",
  "start": 2190.02,
  "end": 2192.35
 },
 {
  "en": "You got my message?",
  "start": 2210.57,
  "end": 2212.63
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 2210.57,
  "end": 2212.63
 },
 {
  "en": "I got her.",
  "start": 2215.98,
  "end": 2217.88
 },
 {
  "en": "She's on her way out.",
  "start": 2215.98,
  "end": 2217.88
 },
 {
  "en": "Follow her. She'll take you right to Scofield.",
  "start": 2218.85,
  "end": 2221.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Sir...",
  "start": 2242.61,
  "end": 2243.97
 },
 {
  "en": "... we need to talk.",
  "start": 2244.71,
  "end": 2246.47
 },
 {
  "en": "In just a few minutes, the president...",
  "start": 2249.05,
  "end": 2251.45
 },
 {
  "en": "... is going to announce a pardon for Burrows and Scofield.",
  "start": 2251.62,
  "end": 2255.35
 },
 {
  "en": "As you're well aware, this is quite a departure.",
  "start": 2255.52,
  "end": 2258.08
 },
 {
  "en": "She's always been willing to play ball but I think we need to take some action.",
  "start": 2259.02,
  "end": 2262.69
 },
 {
  "en": "Sir...",
  "start": 2264.26,
  "end": 2265.59
 },
 {
  "en": "... I hate to disturb you...",
  "start": 2268.0,
  "end": 2270.3
 },
 {
  "en": "... but I'm not sure you realize the gravity of what she's about to do.",
  "start": 2270.9,
  "end": 2275.77
 },
 {
  "en": "Michael.",
  "start": 2294.59,
  "end": 2297.29
 },
 {
  "en": "Sara.",
  "start": 2294.59,
  "end": 2297.29
 },
 {
  "en": "It worked.",
  "start": 2297.56,
  "end": 2300.5
 },
 {
  "en": "The pardon?",
  "start": 2297.56,
  "end": 2300.5
 },
 {
  "en": "She's announcing it any minute.",
  "start": 2301.33,
  "end": 2303.73
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, my God.",
  "start": 2304.7,
  "end": 2307.07
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, my God. Michael, that's amazing.",
  "start": 2307.8,
  "end": 2309.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Just get here, okay?",
  "start": 2309.91,
  "end": 2311.81
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm on...",
  "start": 2313.24,
  "end": 2315.41
 },
 {
  "en": "... Highland. It's a warehouse that runs right down to the water.",
  "start": 2315.88,
  "end": 2319.21
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah. Yeah, I'm on my way.",
  "start": 2319.38,
  "end": 2321.75
 },
 {
  "en": "We did it.",
  "start": 2360.39,
  "end": 2363.19
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah?",
  "start": 2360.39,
  "end": 2363.19
 },
 {
  "en": "What happened to your face, man?",
  "start": 2366.63,
  "end": 2368.06
 },
 {
  "en": "If you wanna take the ride...",
  "start": 2368.73,
  "end": 2371.36
 },
 {
  "en": "... you gotta buy the ticket.",
  "start": 2372.07,
  "end": 2373.73
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, right. Well, Derek hooked us up with a cabin on one of those freighters.",
  "start": 2374.04,
  "end": 2378.27
 },
 {
  "en": "South America via the Great Lakes.",
  "start": 2378.61,
  "end": 2380.34
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, we're not gonna need that. But this is appreciated.",
  "start": 2380.51,
  "end": 2385.54
 },
 {
  "en": "One more time, bro.",
  "start": 2385.72,
  "end": 2387.84
 },
 {
  "en": "We did it?",
  "start": 2388.02,
  "end": 2390.95
 },
 {
  "en": "It's done.",
  "start": 2388.02,
  "end": 2390.95
 },
 {
  "en": "I wish I could've seen the look on her face.",
  "start": 2396.39,
  "end": 2398.95
 },
 {
  "en": "No, you don't.",
  "start": 2399.73,
  "end": 2400.89
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, yeah, I do.",
  "start": 2402.27,
  "end": 2403.76
 },
 {
  "en": "Unbelievable.",
  "start": 2408.57,
  "end": 2411.67
 },
 {
  "en": "She's gonna do it.",
  "start": 2408.57,
  "end": 2411.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Unbelievable.",
  "start": 2413.08,
  "end": 2414.67
 },
 {
  "en": "The president is now taking the stage here at the Grand Carlisle Hotel.",
  "start": 2416.38,
  "end": 2420.21
 },
 {
  "en": "The 2-hour delay in her appearance...",
  "start": 2420.38,
  "end": 2422.44
 },
 {
  "en": "... due to an investigation characterized by Press Secretary Ryan Berg...",
  "start": 2422.62,
  "end": 2426.45
 },
 {
  "en": "... as \" an over-zealous fan \"....",
  "start": 2426.62,
  "end": 2429.18
 },
 {
  "en": "You are not going to do this.",
  "start": 2435.13,
  "end": 2438.4
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm afraid I am.",
  "start": 2435.13,
  "end": 2438.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Developments you need to be aware of.",
  "start": 2438.57,
  "end": 2441.87
 },
 {
  "en": "I have made my decision...",
  "start": 2438.57,
  "end": 2441.87
 },
 {
  "en": "... and I would appreciate you not second-guessing me.",
  "start": 2442.04,
  "end": 2445.13
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't think you understand. We know your secrets too.",
  "start": 2445.31,
  "end": 2448.61
 },
 {
  "en": "We can reveal them just as easily.",
  "start": 2450.85,
  "end": 2452.51
 },
 {
  "en": "You need to ask yourself who you fear more. Michael Scofield...",
  "start": 2453.35,
  "end": 2456.32
 },
 {
  "en": "... or us?",
  "start": 2457.09,
  "end": 2458.18
 },
 {
  "en": "You've got 30 seconds.",
  "start": 2458.66,
  "end": 2460.42
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 2458.66,
  "end": 2460.42
 },
 {
  "en": "I won't keep you.",
  "start": 2460.59,
  "end": 2462.35
 },
 {
  "en": "The world is waiting.",
  "start": 2463.19,
  "end": 2465.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Ten seconds.",
  "start": 2463.19,
  "end": 2465.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Ladies and gentlemen, the President of the United States.",
  "start": 2465.73,
  "end": 2468.46
 },
 {
  "en": "Nine, eight, seven, six, five...",
  "start": 2468.63,
  "end": 2473.97
 },
 {
  "en": "... four, three, two....",
  "start": 2474.14,
  "end": 2477.87
 },
 {
  "en": "Thank you for waiting so patiently all afternoon.",
  "start": 2479.81,
  "end": 2484.54
 },
 {
  "en": "If it were not for the support of this great state...",
  "start": 2484.98,
  "end": 2488.51
 },
 {
  "en": "... my home state of Illinois...",
  "start": 2488.69,
  "end": 2490.88
 },
 {
  "en": "... I would not be here today.",
  "start": 2495.56,
  "end": 2498.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Which is why I have chosen today...",
  "start": 2498.23,
  "end": 2500.89
 },
 {
  "en": "... to make this very important announcement.",
  "start": 2501.07,
  "end": 2505.2
 },
 {
  "en": "A situation has recently come to light...",
  "start": 2506.0,
  "end": 2509.53
 },
 {
  "en": "... and I feel that I must take action.",
  "start": 2509.71,
  "end": 2512.57
 },
 {
  "en": "It is my job as president of this great country...",
  "start": 2513.04,
  "end": 2517.28
 },
 {
  "en": "... to make rational decisions...",
  "start": 2517.45,
  "end": 2520.08
 },
 {
  "en": "... when I am given facts.",
  "start": 2520.25,
  "end": 2522.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Decisions that are best not for me but for the people.",
  "start": 2523.25,
  "end": 2528.21
 },
 {
  "en": "And so...",
  "start": 2530.19,
  "end": 2531.86
 },
 {
  "en": "... after much consideration...",
  "start": 2532.03,
  "end": 2535.05
 },
 {
  "en": "... I regret to inform you...",
  "start": 2535.23,
  "end": 2538.46
 },
 {
  "en": "... that I have been diagnosed with a highly malignant form of cancer.",
  "start": 2538.74,
  "end": 2543.93
 },
 {
  "en": "And because of that reason...",
  "start": 2548.05,
  "end": 2550.71
 },
 {
  "en": "... I am no longer fit to serve as your commander in chief.",
  "start": 2550.91,
  "end": 2556.15
 },
 {
  "en": "In the best interest of this country, effective immediately...",
  "start": 2557.66,
  "end": 2561.92
 },
 {
  "en": "... I am stepping down as president of the United States.",
  "start": 2562.86,
  "end": 2568.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Ladies and gentlemen, in a shocking announcement....",
  "start": 2572.27,
  "end": 2574.93
 },
 {
  "en": "If she ain't the president, the tape's useless.",
  "start": 2575.11,
  "end": 2578.16
 },
 {
  "en": "She can't pardon anyone.",
  "start": 2578.41,
  "end": 2580.6
 },
 {
  "en": "We got nothing.",
  "start": 2581.88,
  "end": 2583.44
 },
 {
  "en": "She will no longer serve as the president.",
  "start": 2586.15,
  "end": 2588.21
 },
 {
  "en": "There's only one thing we can do.",
  "start": 2588.39,
  "end": 2589.94
 },
 {
  "en": "We gotta disappear.",
  "start": 2592.56,
  "end": 2594.42
 },
 {
  "en": "Forever.",
  "start": 2596.09,
  "end": 2597.53
 }
]